  "title": "Oat and Blueberry Muffins",
  "description": "Non-fat Greek yogurt and applesauce replace the traditional fats in this blueberry muffin recipe made with unbleached flour and whole-grain oat cereal.",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa Shafer"
  ],
